{
  "_note": "Vendored third-party asset for the docs reader's client-side math rendering. Same convention as provenance-mermaid.json. Only the woff2 fonts are vendored: katex.min.css lists woff2 first in every @font-face, so the woff and ttf fallbacks are never fetched by a browser that reads woff2. Update by re-copying a pinned release, checking the tarball against the registry's dist.integrity, and regenerating this file; TestKatexProvenance fails on any drift.",
  "why_vendored": "The reader must render math with no network call. A CDN script tag would make opening a local document a third-party request, which is exactly the posture this tool is built to avoid.",
